# That is the v0.2.2-rc1 selection. It retains engine 8f423846, floating chrome,
# model setup, native build support and the user-supplied model installation
# path.
# rc2 merges that line with the lazy TTS work (30922e5e through 29fbaa5): the
# host installs the pinned Piper runtime only when the neural tier is selected,
