# selector; the full intervening source history needs release review. This
# advance does not overrule the component's own qualification verdict. The
# 01aa6b7 follow-up adds the measured Pocket CPU profile and 20% margin.
# b58b871 adds the measured Whisper small.en profile and `defaults.stt`: the
# dictation model to offer on this hardware class (x86-64 with AVX2, 8 logical
# CPUs, 16 GiB), otherwise small-en-us.
# 849e350 retains catalog-bound YOLOX/EnCodec estimates and adds measured
# Bonsai binary/ternary 512px CPU-VAE preview profiles, scoped to one unmasked
# CUDA GPU0 below 8 GiB. Binary can fit nominal 6 GiB with adequate free
# RAM/VRAM; ternary cannot. These remain development estimates. All 13 gates pass.
