# Advanced from 0.2.1's c19c5452, 7 commits, to work/0.2.1-repo-fixes-r1. Two
# independent seats ACCEPT the advance (0 Critical, 0 High); the graded commit
# is 3da47dec and 401b8ef9 is its strict descendant one commit ahead, changing
# 8 files — Makefiles and tests, no vendored or imported source.
# `git diff --name-only c19c5452 3da47dec -- components/` is 0 files.
# tools/check-upstream.py exits 1 at both commits: a known Medium that tests
# ref-tip equality rather than reachability, quoted here and not repaired.
# b4dc784d, one further commit: tools/verify-layout.py lets a component tree
# differ from its import only at declared local_changes (it had failed three of
# five components on this repository's own Makefiles). make check 18/18.
KILIX_DESKTOP_SDK_REF=b4dc784d38116b3993315b30878dc0ca9decd405
