# 7104ea5, whose record digests for the three speech models are identical.
# 993c8ec adds the owner's faster-whisper-small-en determination (MIT, OpenAI
# and SYSTRAN, whisper card advisory); no other record digest moves. The
# RC5 carrier reads asset records at PLEBIAN_OS_VOICE_CARRIER_CONTENT_REF,
# KILIX_REF's content gitlink. The receipt pin above binds the two independent
# RC5 carrier reviews; runtime and release-artifact qualification remain separate.
KILIX_LICENSE_REF=ca8a0f479893ab9c8cd6cadc2716c474aaad2820
PLEBIAN_OS_VOICE_CARRIER_CONTENT_REF=b7833f3f2986b1c5423898a2130bf345f04f568b
